{"4289180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Long Drift", "steam_appid": 4289180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/f4ade9985482e4aed33060843e11fd68.poster.avif?t=1783840568\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/f4ade9985482e4aed33060843e11fd68.webm?t=1783840568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/f4ade9985482e4aed33060843e11fd68.mp4?t=1783840568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the vast universe from your desktop.</strong><br>This is a desktop exploration game that runs quietly in a corner of your screen while you go about your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between planets, space stations, and resource zones, gathering materials and expanding your reach across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/2638318589dbd4bb85617aa68a7c080a.poster.avif?t=1783840568\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/2638318589dbd4bb85617aa68a7c080a.webm?t=1783840568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/2638318589dbd4bb85617aa68a7c080a.mp4?t=1783840568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, build, and go beyond</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new planets, harvest resources, and upgrade your equipment to build more advanced spacecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests, build colonies on distant planets, and start fresh with a stronger ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As technology evolves, Break past the speed of light and face all kinds of unexpected encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Always on, never in the way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when you’re idle, the universe keeps moving—ships travel, resources grow, and exploration continues.<br>The game stays unobtrusive on your desktop while your journey unfolds in the background.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the universe run entirely on its own,<br>or step in whenever you want to make decisions and change your course.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/f4ade9985482e4aed33060843e11fd68.poster.avif?t=1783840568\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/f4ade9985482e4aed33060843e11fd68.webm?t=1783840568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/f4ade9985482e4aed33060843e11fd68.mp4?t=1783840568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the vast universe from your desktop.</strong><br>This is a desktop exploration game that runs quietly in a corner of your screen while you go about your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel between planets, space stations, and resource zones, gathering materials and expanding your reach across the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/2638318589dbd4bb85617aa68a7c080a.poster.avif?t=1783840568\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/2638318589dbd4bb85617aa68a7c080a.webm?t=1783840568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/extras/2638318589dbd4bb85617aa68a7c080a.mp4?t=1783840568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, build, and go beyond</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new planets, harvest resources, and upgrade your equipment to build more advanced spacecraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests, build colonies on distant planets, and start fresh with a stronger ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As technology evolves, Break past the speed of light and face all kinds of unexpected encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Always on, never in the way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when you’re idle, the universe keeps moving—ships travel, resources grow, and exploration continues.<br>The game stays unobtrusive on your desktop while your journey unfolds in the background.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the universe run entirely on its own,<br>or step in whenever you want to make decisions and change your course.</p>", "short_description": "Build, upgrade, and watch your tiny universe evolve.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/e6a4edf658d763012b6fd0e1d8f24043dc8d8582/header.jpg?t=1783840568", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4289180/94b7f1199e9344a36364cf75ee338e12e8d91f6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783840568", "capsule_imagev5": "https://